3:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24 pb-16","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"mb-12","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent mb-2","children":"Mobile Conversion Diagnostics"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"heading-1 text-fg md:text-5xl","children":"Run a Free Mobile Landing Page Audit to Stop Wasted Ad Spend"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-lg text-fg-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl","children":"When 60–80% of paid ad clicks land on mobile and conversion rates lag desktop, the cause is specific and observable. CTA not visible at 375px. Tap targets under 44px. Desktop-resolution images on a 4G connection. Font sizes triggering iOS zoom. This guide covers each mobile-specific failure with the signal it trips and a bounded fix."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$Le",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=mobile-audit-hero&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$Le",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-14","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg mb-6","children":"Six mobile-specific conversion failures"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/20 p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 mb-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim mt-0.5","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent mb-0.5","children":"CTA visibility"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-fg","children":"Primary CTA not visible on 375px viewport without scrolling"}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted leading-6 mb-3 pl-7","children":"The most common mobile conversion failure is structural: the primary call to action is positioned below a hero section, a headline, and a value proposition paragraph - none of which is the CTA. On a 375px viewport, this typically places the buy button or form submit below the first scroll. Visitors who don't scroll don't see the action they arrived to take. Meta, TikTok, and Instagram traffic arrive on mobile by default - this failure affects the majority of paid click volume."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pl-7 border-l-2 border-accent/30 ml-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-1","children":"Fix"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted leading-6","children":"Reorder the above-fold layout for mobile: headline, value statement, primary CTA - in that order, all within the first 600px of the viewport on a 375px screen. Verify in Chrome DevTools device simulation. Supporting content - testimonials, feature details, FAQs - belongs below the fold."}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/20 p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 mb-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim mt-0.5","children":"02"}],"$Lf"]}],"$L10","$L11"]}],"$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15"]}]]}],"$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19"]}]}]
